-- ============================================================================
--  PestCure — create / refresh all 20 weekly-review role templates
--  Paste this whole file into Supabase  >  SQL Editor  >  Run.
--
--  Templates live inside your workspace row (public.workspaces.data->'roles').
--  This script upserts the 20 templates by id:
--    * a template with the same id is replaced with this definition
--    * any other (custom) role you already have is kept untouched
--    * people, reviews, targets, settings and history are NOT touched
--
--    1. Customer Care & Operations  (6 KPIs)
--    2. Tender Operations & Bidding  (20 KPIs)
--    3. Commercial & Business Development  (16 KPIs)
--    4. Field Operations  (4 KPIs)
--    5. Accounts & Payments Executive  (9 KPIs)
--    6. Accounts & Payroll Executive  (8 KPIs)
--    7. Sales Supervisor — CRM & Leads (Dharam)  (12 KPIs)
--    8. Sales Supervisor — CRM & Leads (Gautam)  (12 KPIs)
--    9. Sales Supervisor — CRM & Leads (Mark David)  (12 KPIs)
--   10. Sales Supervisor — CRM & Leads (Dharmendra)  (12 KPIs)
--   11. Sales Supervisor — CRM & Leads (Ravi)  (12 KPIs)
--   12. BD Executive — Sales Support  (12 KPIs)
--   13. Technician Operations Supervisor  (14 KPIs)
--   14. DS Schedule & Operations Coordinator  (15 KPIs)
--   15. Customer Care Executive — Data & Billing  (13 KPIs)
--   16. Schedule Management Executive  (12 KPIs)
--   17. Reticulation Sales & Team Building  (12 KPIs)
--   18. Project Sales & Business Development  (13 KPIs)
--   19. Sales & Lead Management Executive  (13 KPIs)
--   20. CRM & Supervisor Lead  (26 KPIs)
--
--  The SQL Editor does not run as a logged-in user, so the owner is matched
--  by email in the params CTE below. Change it if you sign in differently.
--
--  Prerequisite: sign in to the app at least once so your workspace row exists.
--  If the verify query at the end returns 0 rows, the email did not match a
--  workspace — sign in once, then run this file again.
-- ============================================================================

